  <main_text>
    <l n="1">5. Nos verba non mutamus ; sed</l>
    <l n="2">quod initio dictum est de isto die septi-</l>
    <l n="3">mo, applicamus ad nostrum diem septi-</l>
    <l n="4">mum: quemadmodum quod de Evâ</l>
    <l n="5">dictum, applicamus analogicè ad nostras</l>
    <l n="6">Uxores,&amp;c. quodque de terrâ olim</l>
    <l n="7">Israëlitis datâ dictum est,applicamus quodam-</l>
    <l n="8">modò ad terram nobis datam ; &amp;c.</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">IV. <i>Occurrit alius ;</i> Si quis neget, <i>ra-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">
      <i>tionem</i> quæ in Decalogo Exod. xx, affer-</l>
    <l n="11">tur, quód Deus quieverit die septimo,<i>esse</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>aptam natam fundare Præceptum cerimo-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>niale typicum, adventum Messiæ &amp; redem-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>ptionem per ipsum peragendam prefigurans</i>;</l>
    <l n="15">is Deo asserenti, quod <i>Sabbatha dederit in</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>signum notificans &amp; obsignans sanctificationem,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">contradicit.</l>
    <l n="18" para="true">
      <i>Resp.</i> 1. Non negavi Sabbatha, quæ</l>
    <l n="19">&amp; quomodò observari debuerunt sub V.</l>
    <l n="20">T. data esse in signum notificans &amp; obsi-</l>
    <l n="21">gnans sanctificationem. Imò hoc ipsum</l>
    <l n="22">doceo, explico, confirmo alibi.</l>
    <l n="23" para="true">2. Sed dixi ; Rationem illam</l>
    <l n="24">
      <i>Exod. xx.</i> à Quiete ipsius Dei, cùm opera creati-</l>
    <l n="25">onis per sex dies essent consummata, suâ a-</l>
    <l n="26">ntiquitate antevertere Cerimonias typi-</l>
    <l n="27">cas:</l>
  </main_text>
